NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the source code in this repository only. It does not cover
the dataset, which is not included.

The models were trained on the human acetylcholinesterase classification dataset
of Vignaux PA, Lane TR, Urbina F, Gerlach J, Puhl AC, Snyder SH, Ekins S,
Chem Res Toxicol 2023;36(2):188-201, doi:10.1021/acs.chemrestox.2c00283,
distributed with that article under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International licence
(CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/). Because
that licence does not permit redistribution of modified versions, the reduced
two-column table used in this work is not redistributed here. Obtain the data
from the source article and follow its terms; README.md explains how to rebuild
the table.

Result files in this repository are provided so that the reported numbers can
be verified. Class labels they contain derive from the source dataset and
remain subject to its licence.
